flowchart TD
  NET[Station network] --> BLOCKS[Assign to spatial blocks]
  BLOCKS --> PICK[Pick one block as test]
  PICK --> CAND[Candidate train = other blocks]
  CAND --> BUF{within buffer of\na test station?}
  BUF -->|yes| DROP[drop from train]
  BUF -->|no| KEEP[keep in train]
  KEEP --> FIT[fit models]
  DROP --> LOG[count dropped to buffer]
  FIT --> EVAL[evaluate on test block]
  EVAL --> METR[RMSE, coverage,\nerror vs distance to network]
